@startuml F-SQ2_defaulters_and_session_plan
' F-SQ2 Sequence: generating a defaulter list and outreach session plan (proposal 3.4 item 3.2).
' Requirements: FR-20 to FR-23, BR-01 to BR-04. Use cases: UC-09, UC-10.
!include style.iuml
autonumber

actor "Facility manager" as FM
participant "React app" as UI
participant "DRF API\n(JWT, facility scope)" as API
participant "SchedulingService" as SCH
participant "PassportService" as PP
participant "InventoryService" as INV
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Defaulter list (UC-09) ==
FM -> UI : open Scheduling
UI -> API : GET /api/v1/defaulters?on=today
API -> API : authenticate, role, facility scope
API -> SCH : defaulters(facility, today)
SCH -> DB : children of facility, their events, ScheduleDose
DB --> SCH : rows
loop each child
  SCH -> PP : dose_statuses(child, today)
  PP --> SCH : given | due | overdue | closed per dose\n(BR-01 min age and interval, BR-02 grace 28 days, BR-03 max age)
end
SCH -> SCH : keep children with >= 1 overdue dose (FR-21)
SCH -> SCH : rank (BR-04): overdue count desc,\ndays to nearest max age asc, system ID
SCH --> API : ranked defaulters
API --> UI : 200 JSON
UI --> FM : prioritised defaulter list

== Session plan (UC-10) ==
FM -> UI : create outreach session (date, location, capacity)
UI -> API : POST /api/v1/sessions
API -> DB : insert OutreachSession (status planned)
UI -> API : POST /api/v1/sessions/{id}/plan
API -> SCH : plan(session, user)
SCH -> SCH : take ranked defaulters up to capacity
SCH -> DB : insert SessionPlanItem (child, dose, rank)
SCH -> INV : balance and latest Forecast per antigen
INV --> SCH : doses available by session date
SCH -> SCH : shortfalls = doses needed - doses available (FR-23)
SCH -> DB : AuditLog (create plan)
SCH --> API : plan items, doses needed per antigen, shortfalls
API --> UI : 201 JSON
UI --> FM : session plan with vaccines to carry\nand shortfall warnings
@enduml
